WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
[Soft, slow ambient music]

00:00.900 --> 00:05.200
21:00, the hour before sleep. A low sun sinks behind a landscape drawn in glowing contour lines.

00:06.400 --> 00:12.600
Across the city, lit windows go dark one by one, until a single window is left.

00:12.800 --> 00:18.600
A paper boat drifts on a moonlit lake while the ripples settle. Let the day settle.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.200
Pale moonflowers fold their petals shut as fireflies drift between them.

00:25.200 --> 00:31.200
The moon turns from a thin crescent to full, then wanes again.

00:31.200 --> 00:36.200
Inside a paper lantern, the flame shrinks, flickers and goes out.

00:36.500 --> 00:40.000
The Stillhour mark, a crescent in a circle. 22:00, goodnight.
